...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd so they were a present from that famous neighbor of\nours?\d%K%P
「额…这个就是那个邻居带过来的土产？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIt's incredible, dude. Apparently, this really famous\nsweet shop in California only makes fifty of those cream\npuffs per day as a special order.\d%K%P
「很厉害吧。说是加利福尼亚有名的西点店制作、\n一天限定出售５０个的超珍稀奶油泡芙」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dRight... So where exactly did those cream puffs go,\nthen?\d%K%P
「那…最重要的奶油泡芙部分呢？」%K%P
There were signs of their presence in my room at one point\nor another. Namely, a large yet empty, white box with some\ncrumbs resting at the bottom.%K%P
在我房间的桌子上面，\n赫然放着的大号白色纸盒\n表明那个点心确实曾经存在。%K%P
It had been licked so clean there wasn't even any leftover\ncream.%K%P
…然而整个盒子内部则是空空如也。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, there were only twelve inside. That's the problem\nwith limited items.\d%K%P
「呀，一个盒子里只装了１２个。\n不愧是限定品」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see. I guess that explains the-- Wait a second, that\nshould've been more than enough for me too!!\d%K%P
「这样啊， 那就没办法…\n喂，那不是足够有我的份吗！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWell, it was kind of a perfect split between three\npeople. I wish the neighbor put a little more thought into\nit.\d%K%P
「呀啊，三个人分的话正好合适。\n邻居真是个聪明人啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat makes four puffs for three people! What's wrong with\nthree puffs for four people?!\d%K%P
「三个人每个人分了四个对吧！\n四个人不就每人分三个么！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dUgh... I can barely breathe. Guess it really isn't smart\nto overindulge on sweets at my age. Even the sight of hot\ntea fills me with dread nowadays.\d%K%P
「啊～…难受啊。\n果然到了这个岁数就不能乱吃甜的东西了。\n我现在连热茶都怕喝了～」 %K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I only have green tea right now, though. Mitoko gave\nme some the other day.\d%K%P
「………不过这里就只有粗茶了？\n就是之前，美都子分给咱们的那种」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dLaid-off... You're such a good dude! A guy couldn't wish\nfor a more convenient friend.\d%K%P
「失业的…你真是个好人啊。\n在性格和易用度上都是」%K%P
I wasn't entirely happy with the way he put that...%K%P
后者可让人高兴不起来…%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut I wish I could've shown them to you. Those cream\npuffs were shaped like fish, and really weird ones at\nthat.\d%K%P
「但是真想给失业者看看啊。\n那泡芙竟然是鱼形的啊。\n而且那副表情还挺奇怪」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you wanted to show them to me that badly, you could've\nat least left one. Hm? By fish, you don't happen to mean\nkiller whales, do you...?\d%K%P
「想给我看的话给我留一个不就………？\n那个，难道说那个鱼的形状是像鲸鱼一样的？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAh, now that I think about it... The way they had their\njaws open like that, it almost looked like they should be\ngilded and put on the roof of a castle or something.\d%K%P
「啊，这么说的话…\n像这样，那嘴张得大大的，\n就像哪个大城堡瞭望楼上闪烁的灯光一样」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Did those really come from California?%K%P
真的是加利福尼亚的西点屋做的么…？%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, while I hate to interrupt the feast and all...\d%K%P
「那，她为什么要这样招待你们啊…」%K%P
Not like I was invited to it.%K%P
虽然我是没被招待到。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA woman named Sawashiro Himeo approached me with a\nstrange proposition this morning. ...She asked me to move\nout.\d%K%P
「实际上那个泽嶋姬绪小姐，\n跟我说了一些莫名其妙的话。\n…说让我从这公寓里搬出去」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...So the princess came to you as well.\d%K%P
「…公主她果然也找过失业的啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe princess? ...Oh.\d%K%P
「公主？…啊啊」%K%P
I guess that sounds about right.%K%P
原来如此…『姫』绪小姐啊。\n※译注：“姬”在日文中的意思是公主。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI was hoping she'd finally given up, after moving\noverseas to study last year.\d%K%P
「一年前听说她要去留学的时候，\n我还以为她终于要放弃了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh...? So she's been doing it for a while?\d%K%P
「额…也就是说比一年前还早的时候就开始了？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dShe came to my place, saying, 'Your very presence\ndisturbs the public order of East Hagimori.' Pfft, I only\ndisturb order on campus and on stage!\d%K%P
「我是被她指责\n『你在这里住着简直就是坏了东荻守的风纪』。\n明明我扰乱的只有大学附近和电影院周围的的风气而已。」%K%P
So, depending on location, he was definitely a\ndisturbance.%K%P
原来还分地点的啊…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Putting that aside, could you stop with the voices?\nIt's creeping me out.\d%K%P
「…给我正常点说话，你那么变声太瘆得慌了」%K%P
His vocal cords must have been a gift from God.%K%P
八须永君的声线模仿，不夸张地说，连神也会买他的账…%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dShe asked me how much I wanted right off the bat. Can you\nbelieve that? I'm not living here just because the rent is\ncheap.\d%K%P
「我是忽然被告知『那，你想要多少钱？』？\n真是把我当笨蛋了啊。\n我一直住在这又不只是因为房租低」%K%P
Not like he was paying any at all...%K%P
说起来这家伙还没交房租吧…%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dShe introduced me to a home for the elderly. I nearly\nblurted out that if she had time to look after the\nretirement plans of old geezers, she ought to use it to\nlearn some manners first.\d%K%P
「我是被介绍了养老院。\n“有担心别人晚年的闲工夫，还不如先改改你那态度呢”，\n我差点就这么说了」%K%P
I was actually a bit worried myself about Mr. Retired in\nthat regard.%K%P
老爷子的晚年我也确实是很担心…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo... if she said all that to you, why exactly would you\nwolf down her gifts?\d%K%P
「那，你们都被她说到这份上了，\n为什么还要吃她送的土特产啊？」%K%P
%LCKihee & Yoshinori & Buntarou
%LC喜兵卫＆吉则＆文太郎
\dThat's different! The cream puffs did nothing wrong!\d%K%P
「一码归一码。这个可是奶油泡芙啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThe main problem is that the li'l landlord doesn't even\nsuspect that woman's true character.\d%K%P
「更麻烦的是，\n房东小妹完全没有\n认识到那个女人的另一面」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhatever we say, she just brushes it off as a joke. That\nwoman adopts a completely different persona whenever she\ninteracts with her or her mom.\d%K%P
「不管我们说什么，她都觉得我们是开玩笑的，不相信。\n毕竟那个女人唯独在对待阳坂母女的时候表现出的是另一副样子」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you have any idea why she'd want to evict us?\d%K%P
「那女人为什么要把我们从这个公寓里赶出去啊？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI can smell the stench of money in the air. And boy, does\nit reek.\d%K%P
「闻到气味了吧？\n利益的气味冲鼻得很呢」%K%P
Apparently, Mr. Retired came to the same conclusion as me.\nWell, I suppose her last name was enough of a hint.%K%P
果然老爷子和我的推测差不多是一致的。\n不过，听到“泽嶋”这个名字，\n是个人都会往那方面想吧。%K%P
Despite being relative newcomers in the field, the\nSawashima Group had already secured the top spot in this\ncountry's real estate food chain. They didn't land that\nposition simply by playing fair and square all the time.%K%P
泽嶋房地产虽然是房地产业界的新兴企业，\n但它用各种强硬的手段来扩张市场份额，\n迅速成长为了凌驾于各大财团之上的大企业。%K%P
But at the same time, something didn't add up...%K%P
但是，就算是那么大的企业，也有不能搞定的事情。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy would the Sawashima Group be interested in this\nplace? I mean, the land here is valuable, yes, but it's\njust a residential area.\d%K%P
「那个泽嶋房地产，为什么这么执着于这块地？\n确实地皮的价值很高，但周边都是住宅地吧？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dMaybe they're trying to buy up the whole town? And this\nboarding house is just a tiny part of the whole plan?\d%K%P
「说不定是想把这条街整个买下来。\n而这栋公寓没准正好成了绊脚石，\n刚好是他们拿不下的？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dMaybe they're planning to fill the place with\nskyscrapers. Or build a theme park or something.\d%K%P
「以后是会变成高层商业街呢，还是会变成庞大的主题公园呢…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
It sounded like a horror story that introduced more risk\nthan merit as far as a business should be concerned, but\nall we could do was maintain the heavy, oppressive\nsilence.%K%P
虽说有句话叫舍不得孩子套不着狼，\n但目前我们都只能心情沉重地沉默以对。%K%P
Given the sudden growth of the Sawashima Group, we\ncouldn't put even something as crazy as this past them.%K%P
从之前吃过苦头的我们这些大人的角度来看，\n也不得不朝『如果是泽嶋的话，说不定会…』这方面想。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dListen, everyone. As long as the princess is targeting\nour Terrace House Hinosaka, we cannot let her catch us by\nthe tail.\d%K%P
「那个暂且不管，诸位先听我说。\n如果公主大人的目的是这『Terrace House阳之坂』的话，\n我们就只有别让她抓住尾巴了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBy the... tail?\d%K%P
「尾巴…么？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWhy do you think the princess suddenly came back after\nlying low for over a year? What do you think has changed\nhere recently?\d%K%P
「知道吗， 那位公主大人留了一年学突然中途结束，\n现在又回来管闲事，好好想想其中的原因吧。\n这一年间，有什么事情发生变化了？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat's... well...\d%K%P
「这么说的话…就是说」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dThat whole business about our landlord eloping.\d%K%P
「房东小姐的下落不明么…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Right...%K%P
对了…%K%P
I had nearly forgotten about it, but the actual owner of\nthis property -- Hinosaka Honoka -- went missing without a\ntrace.%K%P
最近这不愠不火的生活都让我把那事都忘了，\n如今这所公寓真正的一家之主\n阳坂穗香小姐已经不知所踪了。%K%P
And the one currently taking care of this whole\nestablishment was Hinosaka Mitoko, a schoolgirl. I doubt\nany legal establishment would acknowledge her as either\nthe owner or landlord of this place.%K%P
然后现在，实际打理着这里的阳坂美都子\n还只是个学生。如果说要作为一家之主，作为公寓房东的话，\n大概社会上是不会认同的吧。%K%P
What would happen if City Hall or her school learned of\nthe truth?%K%P
比如说，这个事实\n要是被政府或者学校知道了的话…？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-This is bad, Mr. Retired! We're at a severe\ndisadvantage here!\d%K%P
「不、不妙啊，老爷子…\n情况对我们是压倒性的不利啊！」%K%P
All they had to do was inform one of those authorities.%K%P
没错，对方只需要让政府或者学校知道这个事就行了。%K%P
And then we'd have kind-hearted but completely oblivious\npeople who know nothing of Mitoko's true wishes show up\nand \drescue\d her from this \dunfortunate situation.\d%K%P
只需要那样做，那些虽然很亲切，但却不知道美都子真正心愿的\n『大人』就会出现，把她从他们自认为的\n『不幸境遇』中解救出来。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThis ain't good... I'm pretty sure she already knows\neverything straight from the mouth of the li'l landlord,\nanyway.\d%K%P
「不妙啊…\n这些情报，恐怕早就从房东妹妹的嘴里\n套出来了吧」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDo you have a plan, Mr. Retired? We're gonna end up on\nthe street at this rate...\d%K%P
「有什么好的作战计划么，老爷子？\n这样下去我们也会流落街头的…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHmm...\d%K%P
「唔～嗯…」%K%P
With all our gazes fixed on Mr. Retired, he closed his\neyes, and flapped his hand fan.%K%P
集我们三人的视线于一身的老爷子\n闭上眼晴思考之后，慢慢摇了摇头。%K%P
When he opened his eyes again...%K%P
接着，眼睛睁开的时候…%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, I did have something interesting in mind,\nactually.\d%K%P
「嘛，倒是想到了一个有意思的办法…」   %K%P
...I could see the spark of a revelation in them.%K%P
老人家眼睛里闪出仿佛想到什么新噱头的灵感火花。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dElderly wisdom to the rescue! So what exactly did you\ncome up with?\d%K%P
「姜还是老的辣啊！\n那，究竟是怎么样的办法？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Young Master, you were in love with our landlord,\nweren't you?\d%K%P
「…小少爷， 你是仰慕房东太太的吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-Where did that come from?!\d%K%P
「为、为啥又要扯到这事上！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dNo need to fret, son. I merely decided to fulfill your\nwishes, at least on the surface level. What do you say?\nSounds good, doesn't it?\d%K%P
「听我说。\n你的感情可以只是形式上得到实现哦。\n怎么样，不坏吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What exactly do you mean...?\d%K%P
「这、这究竟是…？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWe simply have to make the first move by making\neverything official.\d%K%P
「总而言之嘛…\n先下手为强，让他们认可就好了啊…」%K%P
Mr. Retired then produced a folded-up piece of paper from\nhis chest pocket.%K%P
说完，老爷子从怀里取出展开了\n一份折成四折的印刷品。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What's this...?\d%K%P
「这、这是…？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWe have to show them that the Young Mistress already has\na legitimate guardian.\d%K%P
「也就是说，小房东的监护人，实际上是好好在这的哦」    %K%P
On the paper he held up, I could make out the phrase\n\dParent-Teacher Conference\d.%K%P
然后，『监护人座谈会的通知』\n这个很让人怀念的文书到了我的手里。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm back!\d%K%P
「我回来了～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh... Hey.\d%K%P
「啊…辛苦了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Are you all alone again?\d%K%P
「…今天也只有天城小姐一个人么？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYep.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
It was already my fifth day, but I had yet to meet anyone\nother than her working in this place.%K%P
我来这里上班已经五天了，\n但还没有碰到除她以外的职员…%K%P
The president seemed to have been in contact with Ms.\nAmagi, occasionally relaying messages through her, but the\nlast time I saw him at the office was during the\ninterview.%K%P
董事长也是，似乎偶尔会和天城小姐联系，\n实际上我就只有面试的时候见过他。%K%P
I found myself being awfully curious about what was going\non with the other employees, but I decided that this week\nI should stop worrying and just observe.%K%P
但是，嘛，虽然我很在意其他职员的情况，\n但还是想在这一周先观察一下情况，\n然后再具体询问天城小姐。%K%P
In truth, I had little time to worry. I finally had some\nwork come my way.%K%P
而且现在也不是思考那些深层次问题的时候。\n工作也终于一点点地在开始做了。%K%P
...I wondered if I was simply running away from reality.%K%P
…话虽如此，但这也不得不说是在逃避现实啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDid I get any messages?\d%K%P
「那，有什么需要我处理的电话么？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThere were a few phone calls. Here you go, I wrote\neverything down.\d%K%P
「有几个电话。\n给你这个，记录」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, thank you very much. You're a lifesaver.\d%K%P
「啊，非常感谢。\n帮大忙了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
There were over ten phone numbers on the memo she'd given\nme. I was hoping I could go back to outside inspection,\nbut I figured a change of plans was in order.%K%P
她递过来的记事本里，有接近１０个待处理的电话记录，\n看来我本应该马上开始外勤的工作日程\n要被迫变更了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... Ah, Kounan Print. I really hope it worked out.\d%K%P
「我看看………啊，航南印刷公司。\n要做些什么调整呢？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm...\d%K%P
「我说啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, yes, what is it?\d%K%P
「啊，是，什么事？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...What've you been doing lately?\d%K%P
「…最近你在做什么啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
Did she just question the point of my very existence\nthere?%K%P
感觉刚才似乎关乎我存在意义的疑问被干脆地提出了，\n是那样么？%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, I mean, I can tell you're working and all... but did\nwe really have anything that should be making you this\nbusy?\d%K%P
「啊，不是，用眼看就能知道你确实是在工作的。\n…但真的有这么多让你忙碌的工作吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA...Ah... I see.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊…说的是这个啊」%K%P
With neither the president nor any other senior employees\naround, I had yet to be given any duties asides from\nstudying protocol.%K%P
确实，由于董事长和其他职员都不露面，\n我现在做的这些工作只能算是在『实习』。%K%P
I was given the documents containing information on our\nclients, our latest receipts, the manuals of our products\nand so on.%K%P
读了之前拿到的客户资料、账本和手册，\n算是记下了工作流程。%K%P
%LCKaya
